//! Provider-neutral capability and resolved-execution composition identities.
//!
//! A capability composition names semantic work. A resolved execution
//! composition names the exact implementation/runtime/environment selection
//! for that work. Neither identity grants authority, establishes currentness,
//! or proves that an execution occurred.

